Use these commands in PowerShell to check your MySQL database quickly.

1. Open MySQL CLI
```powershell
mysql -u root -p
```
Enter your password (`12345` based on your .env).

2. Select DB and list all tables
```sql
USE omnihub_streaming;
SHOW TABLES;
```

3. Check table structure
```sql
DESCRIBE users;
DESCRIBE profiles;
DESCRIBE media_content;
DESCRIBE user_favorites;
DESCRIBE watch_history;
DESCRIBE ratings_reviews;
DESCRIBE subscription_requests;
```

4. See sample data (latest rows)
```sql
SELECT * FROM users ORDER BY user_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM profiles ORDER BY profile_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM media_content ORDER BY content_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM user_favorites ORDER BY favorite_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM watch_history ORDER BY watch_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM ratings_reviews ORDER BY rating_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM subscription_requests ORDER BY request_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM user_subscriptions ORDER BY subscription_id DESC LIMIT 10;
SELECT * FROM subscription_payments ORDER BY payment_id DESC LIMIT 10;
```

5. Check your admin/pro user specifically
```sql
SELECT user_id, full_name, email, role, subscription_status
FROM users
WHERE LOWER(email) = 'adilijaz227@gmail.com';

SELECT us.subscription_id, us.status, sp.plan_code, sp.plan_name, us.started_at, us.expires_at
FROM user_subscriptions us
JOIN subscription_plans sp ON us.plan_id = sp.plan_id
JOIN users u ON us.user_id = u.user_id
WHERE LOWER(u.email) = 'adilijaz227@gmail.com'
ORDER BY us.subscription_id DESC
LIMIT 5;
```

6. Check per-profile favorites/history (important for your latest change)
```sql
SELECT uf.favorite_id, uf.user_id, uf.profile_id, p.profile_name, uf.title, uf.media_type, uf.created_at
FROM user_favorites uf
LEFT JOIN profiles p ON uf.profile_id = p.profile_id
ORDER BY uf.favorite_id DESC
LIMIT 20;

SELECT wh.watch_id, wh.user_id, wh.profile_id, p.profile_name, wh.tmdb_id, wh.media_type, wh.watched_at
FROM watch_history wh
LEFT JOIN profiles p ON wh.profile_id = p.profile_id
ORDER BY wh.watch_id DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

7. Exit MySQL
```sql
EXIT;
```

